{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200bSwipe. Upgrade. Expand.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Celldom is the original web hit, now on Steam.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swipe across a grid of cells to generate income, upgrade individual cells, and expand your board. Unlock dashers for passive income and rebirth to boost your earnings further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version includes Steam achievements, leaderboards, and cloud saves.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're revisiting or discovering it anew, Celldom offers a straightforward, engaging idle experience.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple swipe-based incremental gameplay\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your board and upgrade the cells for more value\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dashers for passive income</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebirth system for progression\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements and leaderboards\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the charm of the original Celldom, now enhanced with Steam features.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661300?t=1746543620","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661300/9957e16b55518678da11daafceca454eba56c494/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746543620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661300/72ccc8cce82bfb9b0923fcefd3cb99e856b5c0c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746543620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661300/72ccc8cce82bfb9b0923fcefd3cb99e856b5c0c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746543620","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descrip